{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1026175-zero-gravity-space-combat-on-a-battlemap","id":1026175,"title":"Zero gravity/space combat on a battlemap.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-03T14:50:49-08:00","id":1026175,"title":"Zero gravity/space combat on a battlemap.","content":"So I may be running a short sci-fi game in the near future but I'm running up against a minor hurdle in the challenge of representing space combat. It's not a huge deal in the grand scheme of things, plenty of sci-fi minis games and even sci-fi properties themselves operate on a more or less two dimensional plane, but what crazy suggestions would people have for at least <i>trying</i> to put weightless three dimensional combat on a table?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T15:11:21-08:00","id":1026182,"title":"","content":"The simplest thing that comes to mind for 3D movement is giving each miniature a little note, preferably an easily erasable one, on which is written how many [movement units used for space combat] that Mini is away from an arbitrary baseline. So all Minis are just sitting on the map, but you know that in-universe, the one marked &quot;-15&quot; is way down from the one marked &quot;+10&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-04T07:29:58-08:00","id":1026503,"title":"","content":"The usual method is to stack poker chips under the minis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-04T10:27:18-08:00","id":1026594,"title":"","content":"Ahh, damn. I was going to recommend <a href=\"http://paizo.com/companies/tinkeredTactics\" target=\"_blank\">Combat Tiers</a>, but apparently they've been discontinued.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}